00:07:34.709 --> 00:07:35.375
THAT, PLEASE?

00:07:35.376 --> 00:07:36.443
WHERE IS THAT A JUDICIAL

00:07:36.444 --> 00:07:38.078
DECISION THAT SAYS THAT?

00:07:38.079 --> 00:07:39.479
I'M AFRAID OUR INTELLIGENCE

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.081
SERVICES HAVE BEEN POLITICIZED.

00:07:41.082 --> 00:07:41.748
JOHN BRENNAN SAYS THE SAME

00:07:41.749 --> 00:07:42.048
THING.

00:07:42.049 --> 00:07:43.483
I DON'T BELIEVE IT TO BE TRUE.

00:07:43.484 --> 00:07:44.551
SO IT'S A CLAIM.

00:07:44.552 --> 00:07:46.920
IT'S NEVER BEEN PROVED IT A U.S.

00:07:46.921 --> 00:07:49.055
COURT OF LAW.

00:07:49.056 --> 00:07:49.756
&gt;&gt; Laura: TALKING ABOUT ROGER

00:07:49.757 --> 00:07:50.223
HAVING GOTTEN --

00:07:50.224 --> 00:07:52.759
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T KNOW THAT PRAYED

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:53.460
&gt;&gt; Laura: EVERYONE CONCLUDED

00:07:53.461 --> 00:07:54.661
BUT THEY PRONOUNCE IT.

00:07:54.662 --> 00:07:55.896
&gt;&gt; IS A TALKING POINT.

00:07:55.897 --> 00:07:57.264
IT'S UNPROVEN IN A COURT OF LAW

00:07:57.265 --> 00:07:59.900
AND I DON'T THINK IT'S TRUE.

00:07:59.901 --> 00:08:01.234
JULIAN ASSANGE WAS INTERVIEWED

00:08:01.235 --> 00:08:02.002
BY SEAN HANNITY, AND HE'S A

00:08:02.003 --> 00:08:02.402
JOURNALIST.

00:08:02.403 --> 00:08:04.437
HE DOES A SAME THING OF

00:08:04.438 --> 00:08:05.038
"THE NEW YORK TIMES" AND

00:08:05.039 --> 00:08:06.072
"THE WASHINGTON POST" AND

00:08:06.073 --> 00:08:06.773
"THE WALL STREET JOURNAL" DO

00:08:06.774 --> 00:08:07.374
POINT &gt;&gt; Laura: ROGER,

00:08:07.375 --> 00:08:07.874
WE'LL BE WATCHING.

00:08:07.875 --> 00:08:11.011
WHEN IS YOUR NEXT APPEARANCE?

00:08:11.012 --> 00:08:14.916
&gt;&gt; I ACTUALLY WILL COME ON WITH

